    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Questor Forgepact",
    "summary": "A friendly IMPERIAL KNIGHTS model’s targeting aura grants +1 BS and [HEAVY] to ranged attacks by ADEPTUS MECHANICUS units at most 6\" away. Each of your TECH-PRIEST models may repair a friendly IMPERIAL KNIGHTS model during your Command phase. Restore D3 wounds to one recipient at most 3\" away, with each recipient eligible once per phase for this ability. Allies share a 500-point cap. Choose RANGERS, VANGUARD, MARSHAL, TECH-PRIEST MANIPULUS or TECH-PRIEST DOMINUS units.",
